    Given array of heights, find max water container can store
    Ex. height = [1,8,6,2,5,4,8,3,7] -> 49, (8 - 1) x min(8, 7)

    2 pointers outside in, greedily iterate pointer w/ lower height

    Time: O(n)
    Space: O(1)
*/

class Solution {
public:
