    Output: [5,6,7,1,2,3,4]

    1.- To avoid problems with the size of the vector we use the remainder of a division.
    2.- Reverse the entire vector.
    3.- Reverse the parts you want to obtain the result.

    Time: O(1)
    Space: O(1)
*/

class Solution {
public:
