    Ex. lists = [[1,4,5],[1,3,4],[2,6]] -> [1,1,2,3,4,4,5,6]

    Min heap -> optimize space w/ divide-and-conquer, merge 2 each time

    Time: O(n log k)
    Space: O(n) -> O(1)
